-   entry .jdkHttpserver   `Http` served by the JDK's `Httpd` on `localhost`
-       Forwards `scintillate.httpServers.jdkHttpserver`: the server built on the JDK's
-       `com.sun.net.httpserver`, bound to the loopback interface only.
-   entry .jdkHttpserverPublic   `Http` served by the JDK's `Httpd` on every interface
-       Forwards `scintillate.httpServers.jdkHttpserverPublic`: as `jdkHttpserver`, but bound
-       to every network interface, so reachable from other machines.
-   entry .soundnessHttpd   `Http` served by scintillate's own `SocketServer` on `localhost`
-       Forwards `scintillate.httpServers.soundnessHttpd`: Soundness's own server, which also
-       speaks HTTP/2 over TLS, bound to the loopback interface only.
-   entry .soundnessHttpdPublic   `Http` served by scintillate's own `SocketServer` on every interface
-       Forwards `scintillate.httpServers.soundnessHttpdPublic`: as `soundnessHttpd`, but bound
-       to every network interface.
+   entry .jdkHttpserver   `Http` servito dall'`Httpd` del JDK su `localhost`
+       Inoltra `scintillate.httpServers.jdkHttpserver`: il server costruito su
+       `com.sun.net.httpserver` del JDK, legato solo all'interfaccia di loopback.
+   entry .jdkHttpserverPublic   `Http` servito dall'`Httpd` del JDK su ogni interfaccia
+       Inoltra `scintillate.httpServers.jdkHttpserverPublic`: come `jdkHttpserver`, ma legato a
+       ogni interfaccia di rete, quindi raggiungibile da altre macchine.
+   entry .soundnessHttpd   `Http` servito dal `SocketServer` proprio di scintillate su `localhost`
+       Inoltra `scintillate.httpServers.soundnessHttpd`: il server proprio di Soundness, che
+       parla anche HTTP/2 su TLS, legato solo all'interfaccia di loopback.
+   entry .soundnessHttpdPublic   `Http` servito dal `SocketServer` proprio di scintillate su ogni interfaccia
+       Inoltra `scintillate.httpServers.soundnessHttpdPublic`: come `soundnessHttpd`, ma legato
+       a ogni interfaccia di rete.
